```

This handler POSTs to `/api/orchestrators`, receives the new orchestrator, and updates local state via `setActiveOrchestrators`. It's passed to `ProjectsOverview` at `Dashboard.tsx:628` via `onSpawnOrchestrator={handleSpawnOrchestrator}`.

### Where the spawn button DOES render — only in the all-projects overview card

`packages/web/src/components/Dashboard.tsx:899-916`:
```tsx
