This is only rendered inside `ProjectsOverview`, which only shows when `allProjectsView` is true. Single-project view never renders this card, so the user has no path.

### Mobile bottom nav — disabled placeholder, no handler

`packages/web/src/components/MobileBottomNav.tsx:62-70`:
