When viewing a single project with zero orchestrators, `OrchestratorControl` should render a **"Spawn Orchestrator"** button (identical to the one in the overview card) that calls the same handler that POSTs to `/api/orchestrators`. After a successful spawn, the control should transition to the single-orchestrator link state.

