| Spawn failure | Session creation fails | `session-manager.ts:1203` |
| Restore failure | Session restore fails | `session-manager.ts:1544` |

### User-Facing Impact

1. `ao start` fails with "working tree already exists" or "branch already checked out"
2. `git worktree list` shows phantom entries pointing to deleted directories
3. Manual `git worktree prune` required to recover
4. The SIGTERM graceful shutdown has a 10-second hard timeout (`start.ts:2267`) — if worktree cleanup is slow, the process exits without any cleanup at all

